									<div class="site-panel__cafeinfo-description" data-js="site-panel__cafeinfo-description">

						<div class="site-panel__cafeinfo-summary" id="site-panel__cafeinfo-summary" data-js="site-panel__cafeinfo-summary" aria-hidden="true">
							<p><span>Located on the second floor of <span>Buntrock</span> Commons, <span>Stav</span> Hall is the central dining room on campus. It offers students and guests all-you-can-eat dining for breakfast, lunch, and dinner. Stations throughout the cafeteria offer a wide variety of food, from chef-carved meats with home-style casseroles to creative vegan entrees to pan-Asian cuisine. <span>Stav</span> Hall also features two soups made in house daily, an extensive fruit and salad bar, and a selection of outstanding desserts.</span></p>
						</div>

						<div class="u-visual-hide">
							<p><span>Located on the second floor of <span>Buntrock</span> Commons, <span>Stav</span> Hall is the central dining room on campus. It offers students and guests all-you-can-eat dining for breakfast, lunch, and dinner. Stations throughout the cafeteria offer a wide variety of food, from chef-carved meats with home-style casseroles to creative vegan entrees to pan-Asian cuisine. <span>Stav</span> Hall also features two soups made in house daily, an extensive fruit and salad bar, and a selection of outstanding desserts.</span></p>
						</div>

					</div>
				
